  m_Name: Banker Brooks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Banker Brooks
  offerText: Buy into my overseas shipping syndicate today. It requires a hefty sum
    upfront, but when the ships dock, the dividends will leave you immensely satisfied.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the capital. You spend the hour anxiously awaiting
    news from the docks.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to risk your capital on the high seas. Your money
    stays safely in your pocket.
  acceptedDelayedText: The ships arrive! Your investment pays off handsomely, leaving
    your wallet bursting.
  rejectedDelayedText: You read the newspaper. Brooks' ships brought in a fortune.
    The crushing realization of the missed opportunity ruins your mood completely.
  accepted: 1
